Modifications: UmeTrack wrist transforms, joint angles and hand confidences, 2D hand boxes and the
hand_visible / hand_pose_available masks, resampled onto the 30 Hz RGB frame grid and rotated into
the upright display frame; stored as base64 float32 and uint8.
